{"v":[{"a":["ٱلۡحَآقَّةُ"],"t":"The Reality","l":"Al-Haqqahu","w":[["al-ḥāqatu","The Inevitable Reality"]]},{"a":["مَا","ٱلۡحَآقَّةُ"],"t":"What is the Reality","l":"Ma Al-Haqqahu","w":[["mā","What"],["l-ḥāqatu","(is) the Inevitable Reality"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","ٱلۡحَآقَّةُ"],"t":"What will make you understand what the Reality is","l":"Wa Ma 'Adraka Ma Al-Haqqahu","w":[["wamā","And what"],["adrāka","will make you know"],["mā","what"],["l-ḥāqatu","(is) the Inevitable Reality"]]},{"a":["كَذَّبَتۡ","ثَمُودُ","وَعَادُۢ","بِٱلۡقَارِعَةِ"],"t":"Thamood and Aad denied the Catastrophe","l":"Kadhabat Thamudu Wa `Adun Bil-Qari`ahi","w":[["kadhabat","Denied"],["thamūdu","Thamud"],["waʿādun","and Aad"],["bil-qāriʿati","the Striking Calamity"]]},{"a":["فَأَمَّا","ثَمُودُ","فَأُهۡلِكُواْ","بِٱلطَّاغِيَةِ"],"t":"As for Thamood, they were annihilated by the Overwhelming","l":"Fa'amma Thamudu Fa'uhliku Bit-Taghiyahi","w":[["fa-ammā","So as for"],["thamūdu","Thamud"],["fa-uh'likū","they were destroyed"],["bil-ṭāghiyati","by the overpowering (blast)"]]},{"a":["وَأَمَّا","عَادٞ","فَأُهۡلِكُواْ","بِرِيحٖ","صَرۡصَرٍ","عَاتِيَةٖ"],"t":"And as for Aad; they were annihilated by a furious, roaring wind","l":"Wa 'Amma `Adun Fa'uhliku Birihin Sarsarin `Atiyahin","w":[["wa-ammā","And as for"],["ʿādun","Aad"],["fa-uh'likū","they were destroyed"],["birīḥin","by a wind"],["ṣarṣarin","screaming"],["ʿātiyatin","violent"]]},{"a":["سَخَّرَهَا","عَلَيۡهِمۡ","سَبۡعَ","لَيَالٖ","وَثَمَٰنِيَةَ","أَيَّامٍ","حُسُومٗاۖ","فَتَرَى","ٱلۡقَوۡمَ","فِيهَا","صَرۡعَىٰ","كَأَنَّهُمۡ","أَعۡجَازُ","نَخۡلٍ","خَاوِيَةٖ"],"t":"He unleashed it upon them for seven nights and eight days, in succession. You could see the people tossed around, as though they were stumps of hollow palm-trees","l":"Sakhkharaha `Alayhim Sab`a Layalin Wa Thamaniyata 'Ayyamin Husumaan Fatara Al-Qawma Fiha Sar`a Ka'annahum 'A`jazu Nakhlin Khawiyahin","w":[["sakharahā","Which He imposed"],["ʿalayhim","upon them"],["sabʿa","(for) seven"],["layālin","nights"],["wathamāniyata","and eight"],["ayyāmin","days"],["ḥusūman","(in) succession"],["fatarā","so you would see"],["l-qawma","the people"],["fīhā","therein"],["ṣarʿā","fallen"],["ka-annahum","as if they were"],["aʿjāzu","trunks"],["nakhlin","(of) date-palms"],["khāwiyatin","hollow"]]},{"a":["فَهَلۡ","تَرَىٰ","لَهُم","مِّنۢ","بَاقِيَةٖ"],"t":"Can you see any remnant of them","l":"Fahal Tara Lahum Min Baqiyahin","w":[["fahal","Then do"],["tarā","you see"],["lahum","of them"],["min","any"],["bāqiyatin","remains"]]},{"a":["وَجَآءَ","فِرۡعَوۡنُ","وَمَن","قَبۡلَهُۥ","وَٱلۡمُؤۡتَفِكَٰتُ","بِٱلۡخَاطِئَةِ"],"t":"Then Pharaoh came, and those before him, and the Overturned Cities steeped in sin","l":"Wa Ja'a Fir`awnu Wa Man Qablahu Wa Al-Mu'utafikatu Bil-Khati'ahi","w":[["wajāa","And came"],["fir'ʿawnu","Firaun"],["waman","and (those)"],["qablahu","before him"],["wal-mu'tafikātu","and the overturned cities"],["bil-khāṭi-ati","with sin"]]},{"a":["فَعَصَوۡاْ","رَسُولَ","رَبِّهِمۡ","فَأَخَذَهُمۡ","أَخۡذَةٗ","رَّابِيَةً"],"t":"But they disobeyed the messenger of their Lord, so He seized them with an overpowering grip","l":"Fa`asaw Rasula Rabbihim Fa'akhadhahum 'Akhdhatan Rabiyahan","w":[["faʿaṣaw","And they disobeyed"],["rasūla","(the) Messenger"],["rabbihim","(of) their Lord"],["fa-akhadhahum","so He seized them"],["akhdhatan","(with) a seizure"],["rābiyatan","exceeding"]]},{"a":["إِنَّا","لَمَّا","طَغَا","ٱلۡمَآءُ","حَمَلۡنَٰكُمۡ","فِي","ٱلۡجَارِيَةِ"],"t":"When the waters overflowed, We carried you in the cruising ship","l":"Inna Lamma Tagha Al-Ma'u Hamalnakum Fi Al-Jariyahi","w":[["innā","Indeed, We"],["lammā","when"],["ṭaghā","overflowed"],["l-māu","the water"],["ḥamalnākum","We carried you"],["fī","in"],["l-jāriyati","the sailing (ship)"]]},{"a":["لِنَجۡعَلَهَا","لَكُمۡ","تَذۡكِرَةٗ","وَتَعِيَهَآ","أُذُنٞ","وَٰعِيَةٞ"],"t":"To make it a lesson for you—so that retaining ears may retain it","l":"Linaj`alaha Lakum Tadhkiratan Wa Ta`iyaha 'Udhunun Wa`iyahun","w":[["linajʿalahā","That We might make it"],["lakum","for you"],["tadhkiratan","a reminder"],["wataʿiyahā","and would be conscious of it"],["udhunun","an ear"],["wāʿiyatun","conscious"]]},{"a":["فَإِذَا","نُفِخَ","فِي","ٱلصُّورِ","نَفۡخَةٞ","وَٰحِدَةٞ"],"t":"Then, when the Trumpet is sounded a single time","l":"Fa'idha Nufikha Fi As-Suri Nafkhatun Wahidahun","w":[["fa-idhā","Then when"],["nufikha","is blown"],["fī","in"],["l-ṣūri","the trumpet "],["nafkhatun","a blast"],["wāḥidatun","single"]]},{"a":["وَحُمِلَتِ","ٱلۡأَرۡضُ","وَٱلۡجِبَالُ","فَدُكَّتَا","دَكَّةٗ","وَٰحِدَةٗ"],"t":"And the earth and the mountains are lifted up, and crushed, with a single crush","l":"Wa Humilati Al-'Arđu Wa Al-Jibalu Fadukkata Dakkatan Wahidahan","w":[["waḥumilati","And are lifted"],["l-arḍu","the earth"],["wal-jibālu","and the mountains"],["fadukkatā","and crushed"],["dakkatan","(with) a crushing"],["wāḥidatan","single"]]},{"a":["فَيَوۡمَئِذٖ","وَقَعَتِ","ٱلۡوَاقِعَةُ"],"t":"On that Day, the Event will come to pass","l":"Fayawma'idhin Waqa`ati Al-Waqi`ahu","w":[["fayawma-idhin","Then (on) that Day"],["waqaʿati","will occur"],["l-wāqiʿatu","the Occurrence"]]},{"a":["وَٱنشَقَّتِ","ٱلسَّمَآءُ","فَهِيَ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","وَاهِيَةٞ"],"t":"And the heaven will crack; so on that Day it will be frail","l":"Wa Anshaqqati As-Sama'u Fahiya Yawma'idhin Wa Ahiyahun","w":[["wa-inshaqqati","And will split"],["l-samāu","the heaven"],["fahiya","so it"],["yawma-idhin","(is on) that Day"],["wāhiyatun","frail"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡمَلَكُ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَرۡجَآئِهَاۚ","وَيَحۡمِلُ","عَرۡشَ","رَبِّكَ","فَوۡقَهُمۡ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","ثَمَٰنِيَةٞ"],"t":"And the angels will be ranged around its borders, while eight will be carrying the Throne of your Lord above them that Day","l":"Wa Al-Malaku `Ala 'Arja'iha Wa Yahmilu `Arsha Rabbika Fawqahum Yawma'idhin Thamaniyahun","w":[["wal-malaku","And the Angels"],["ʿalā","(will be) on"],["arjāihā","its edges"],["wayaḥmilu","and will bear"],["ʿarsha","(the) Throne"],["rabbika","(of) your Lord"],["fawqahum","above them"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["thamāniyatun","eight"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَئِذٖ","تُعۡرَضُونَ","لَا","تَخۡفَىٰ","مِنكُمۡ","خَافِيَةٞ"],"t":"On that Day you will be exposed, and no secret of yours will remain hidden","l":"Yawma'idhin Tu`rađuna La Takhfa Minkum Khafiyahun","w":[["yawma-idhin","That Day"],["tuʿ'raḍūna","you will be exhibited"],["lā","not"],["takhfā","will be hidden"],["minkum","among you"],["khāfiyatun","any secret"]]},{"a":["فَأَمَّا","مَنۡ","أُوتِيَ","كِتَٰبَهُۥ","بِيَمِينِهِۦ","فَيَقُولُ","هَآؤُمُ","ٱقۡرَءُواْ","كِتَٰبِيَهۡ"],"t":"As for him who is given his book in his right hand, he will say, “Here, take my book and read it","l":"Fa'amma Man 'Utiya Kitabahu Biyaminihi Fayaqulu Ha'uum Aqra'u Kitabi","w":[["fa-ammā","Then as for"],["man","(him) who"],["ūtiya","is given"],["kitābahu","his record"],["biyamīnihi","in his right hand"],["fayaqūlu","will say"],["hāumu","Here"],["iq'raū","read"],["kitābiyah","my record"]]},{"a":["إِنِّي","ظَنَنتُ","أَنِّي","مُلَٰقٍ","حِسَابِيَهۡ"],"t":"I knew I would be held accountable.”","l":"Inni Zanantu 'Anni Mulaqin Hisabiyah","w":[["innī","Indeed, I"],["ẓanantu","was certain"],["annī","that I"],["mulāqin","(will) meet"],["ḥisābiyah","my account"]]},{"a":["فَهُوَ","فِي","عِيشَةٖ","رَّاضِيَةٖ"],"t":"So he will be in pleasant living","l":"Fahuwa Fi `Ishatin Rađiyahin","w":[["fahuwa","So he"],["fī","(will be) in"],["ʿīshatin","a life"],["rāḍiyatin","pleasant"]]},{"a":["فِي","جَنَّةٍ","عَالِيَةٖ"],"t":"In a lofty Garden","l":"Fi Jannatin `Aliyahin","w":[["fī","In"],["jannatin","a Garden"],["ʿāliyatin","elevated"]]},{"a":["قُطُوفُهَا","دَانِيَةٞ"],"t":"Its pickings are within reach","l":"Qutufuha Daniyahun","w":[["quṭūfuhā","Its clusters of fruits"],["dāniyatun","hanging near"]]},{"a":["كُلُواْ","وَٱشۡرَبُواْ","هَنِيٓـَٔۢا","بِمَآ","أَسۡلَفۡتُمۡ","فِي","ٱلۡأَيَّامِ","ٱلۡخَالِيَةِ"],"t":"“Eat and drink merrily for what you did in the days gone by.”","l":"Kulu Wa Ashrabu Hani'aan Bima 'Aslaftum Fi Al-'Ayyami Al-Khaliyahi","w":[["kulū","Eat"],["wa-ish'rabū","and drink"],["hanīan","(in) satisfaction"],["bimā","for what"],["aslaftum","you sent before you"],["fī","in"],["l-ayāmi","the days"],["l-khāliyati","past"]]},{"a":["وَأَمَّا","مَنۡ","أُوتِيَ","كِتَٰبَهُۥ","بِشِمَالِهِۦ","فَيَقُولُ","يَٰلَيۡتَنِي","لَمۡ","أُوتَ","كِتَٰبِيَهۡ"],"t":"But as for him who is given his book in his left hand, he will say, “I wish I was never given my book","l":"Wa 'Amma Man 'Utiya Kitabahu Bishimalihi Fayaqulu Ya Laytani Lam 'Uta Kitabih","w":[["wa-ammā","But as for"],["man","(him) who"],["ūtiya","is given"],["kitābahu","his record"],["bishimālihi","in his left hand"],["fayaqūlu","will say"],["yālaytanī","O! I wish"],["lam","not"],["ūta","I had been given"],["kitābiyah","my record"]]},{"a":["وَلَمۡ","أَدۡرِ","مَا","حِسَابِيَهۡ"],"t":"And never knew what my account was","l":"Wa Lam 'Adri Ma Hisabih","w":[["walam","And not"],["adri","I had known"],["mā","what"],["ḥisābiyah","(is) my account"]]},{"a":["يَٰلَيۡتَهَا","كَانَتِ","ٱلۡقَاضِيَةَ"],"t":"If only it was the end","l":"Ya Laytaha Kanati Al-Qađiyaha","w":[["yālaytahā","O! I wish it"],["kānati","had been"],["l-qāḍiyata","the end"]]},{"a":["مَآ","أَغۡنَىٰ","عَنِّي","مَالِيَهۡۜ"],"t":"My money cannot avail me","l":"Ma 'Aghna `Anni Malih","w":[["mā","Not"],["aghnā","has availed"],["ʿannī","me"],["māliyah","my wealth"]]},{"a":["هَلَكَ","عَنِّي","سُلۡطَٰنِيَهۡ"],"t":"My power has vanished from me.”","l":"Halaka `Anni Sultanih","w":[["halaka","Is gone"],["ʿannī","from me"],["sul'ṭāniyah","my authority"]]},{"a":["خُذُوهُ","فَغُلُّوهُ"],"t":"“Take him and shackle him","l":"Khudhuhu Faghulluhu","w":[["khudhūhu","Seize him"],["faghullūhu","and shackle him"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","ٱلۡجَحِيمَ","صَلُّوهُ"],"t":"Then scorch him in the Blaze","l":"Thumma Al-Jahima Salluhu","w":[["thumma","Then"],["l-jaḥīma","(into) the Hellfire"],["ṣallūhu","burn him"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","فِي","سِلۡسِلَةٖ","ذَرۡعُهَا","سَبۡعُونَ","ذِرَاعٗا","فَٱسۡلُكُوهُ"],"t":"Then in a chain which length is seventy cubits tie him up","l":"Thumma Fi Silsilatin Dhar`uha Sab`una Dhira`aan Faslukuhu","w":[["thumma","Then"],["fī","into"],["sil'silatin","a chain"],["dharʿuhā","its length"],["sabʿūna","(is) seventy"],["dhirāʿan","cubits"],["fa-us'lukūhu","insert him"]]},{"a":["إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","لَا","يُؤۡمِنُ","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلۡعَظِيمِ"],"t":"For he would not believe in God the Great","l":"Innahu Kana La Yu'uminu Billahi Al-`Azimi","w":[["innahu","Indeed, he"],["kāna","was"],["lā","not"],["yu'minu","believing"],["bil-lahi","in Allah"],["l-ʿaẓīmi","the Most Great"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","يَحُضُّ","عَلَىٰ","طَعَامِ","ٱلۡمِسۡكِينِ"],"t":"Nor would he advocate the feeding of the destitute","l":"Wa La Yahuđđu `Ala Ta`ami Al-Miskini","w":[["walā","And (did) not"],["yaḥuḍḍu","feel the urge"],["ʿalā","on"],["ṭaʿāmi","(the) feeding"],["l-mis'kīni","(of) the poor"]]},{"a":["فَلَيۡسَ","لَهُ","ٱلۡيَوۡمَ","هَٰهُنَا","حَمِيمٞ"],"t":"So he has no friend here today","l":"Falaysa Lahu Al-Yawma Hahuna Hamimun","w":[["falaysa","So not"],["lahu","for him"],["l-yawma","today"],["hāhunā","here"],["ḥamīmun","any devoted friend"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","طَعَامٌ","إِلَّا","مِنۡ","غِسۡلِينٖ"],"t":"And no food except scum","l":"Wa La Ta`amun 'Illa Min Ghislinin","w":[["walā","And not"],["ṭaʿāmun","any food"],["illā","except"],["min","from"],["ghis'līnin","(the) discharge of wounds"]]},{"a":["لَّا","يَأۡكُلُهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","ٱلۡخَٰطِـُٔونَ"],"t":"Which only the sinners eat.”","l":"La Ya'kuluhu 'Illa Al-Khati'una","w":[["lā","Not"],["yakuluhu","will eat it"],["illā","except"],["l-khāṭiūna","the sinners"]]},{"a":["فَلَآ","أُقۡسِمُ","بِمَا","تُبۡصِرُونَ"],"t":"Indeed, I swear by what you see","l":"Fala 'Uqsimu Bima Tubsiruna","w":[["falā","But nay"],["uq'simu","I swear"],["bimā","by what"],["tub'ṣirūna","you see"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","لَا","تُبۡصِرُونَ"],"t":"And by what you do not see","l":"Wa Ma La Tubsiruna","w":[["wamā","And what"],["lā","not"],["tub'ṣirūna","you see"]]},{"a":["إِنَّهُۥ","لَقَوۡلُ","رَسُولٖ","كَرِيمٖ"],"t":"It is the speech of a noble messenger","l":"Innahu Laqawlu Rasulin Karimin","w":[["innahu","Indeed, it (is)"],["laqawlu","surely (the) Word"],["rasūlin","(of) a Messenger"],["karīmin","noble"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","هُوَ","بِقَوۡلِ","شَاعِرٖۚ","قَلِيلٗا","مَّا","تُؤۡمِنُونَ"],"t":"And it is not the speech of a poet—little do you believe","l":"Wa Ma Huwa Biqawli Sha`irin Qalilaan Ma Tu'uminuna","w":[["wamā","And not"],["huwa","it"],["biqawli","(is the) word"],["shāʿirin","(of) a poet"],["qalīlan","little"],["mā","(is) what"],["tu'minūna","you believe"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","بِقَوۡلِ","كَاهِنٖۚ","قَلِيلٗا","مَّا","تَذَكَّرُونَ"],"t":"Nor is it the speech of a soothsayer—little do you take heed","l":"Wa La Biqawli Kahinin Qalilaan Ma Tadhakkaruna","w":[["walā","And not"],["biqawli","(it is the) word"],["kāhinin","(of) a soothsayer"],["qalīlan","little"],["mā","(is) what"],["tadhakkarūna","you take heed"]]},{"a":["تَنزِيلٞ","مِّن","رَّبِّ","ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ"],"t":"It is a revelation from the Lord of the Worlds","l":"Tanzilun Min Rabbi Al-`Alamina","w":[["tanzīlun","(It is) a revelation"],["min","from"],["rabbi","(the) Lord"],["l-ʿālamīna","(of) the worlds"]]},{"a":["وَلَوۡ","تَقَوَّلَ","عَلَيۡنَا","بَعۡضَ","ٱلۡأَقَاوِيلِ"],"t":"Had he falsely attributed some statements to Us","l":"Wa Law Taqawwala `Alayna Ba`đa Al-'Aqawili","w":[["walaw","And if"],["taqawwala","he (had) fabricated"],["ʿalaynā","against Us"],["baʿḍa","some"],["l-aqāwīli","sayings"]]},{"a":["لَأَخَذۡنَا","مِنۡهُ","بِٱلۡيَمِينِ"],"t":"We would have seized him by the right arm","l":"La'akhadhna Minhu Bil-Yamini","w":[["la-akhadhnā","Certainly We (would) have seized"],["min'hu","him"],["bil-yamīni","by the right hand"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","لَقَطَعۡنَا","مِنۡهُ","ٱلۡوَتِينَ"],"t":"Then slashed his lifeline","l":"Thumma Laqata`na Minhu Al-Watina","w":[["thumma","Then"],["laqaṭaʿnā","certainly We (would) have cut off"],["min'hu","from him"],["l-watīna","the aorta"]]},{"a":["فَمَا","مِنكُم","مِّنۡ","أَحَدٍ","عَنۡهُ","حَٰجِزِينَ"],"t":"And none of you could have restrained Us from him","l":"Fama Minkum Min 'Ahadin `Anhu Hajizina","w":[["famā","And not"],["minkum","from you"],["min","any"],["aḥadin","one"],["ʿanhu","[from him]"],["ḥājizīna","(who could) prevent (it)"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَتَذۡكِرَةٞ","لِّلۡمُتَّقِينَ"],"t":"Surely, it is a message for the righteous","l":"Wa 'Innahu Latadhkiratun Lilmuttaqina","w":[["wa-innahu","And indeed, it"],["latadhkiratun","(is) surely a reminder"],["lil'muttaqīna","for the Allah-fearing"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّا","لَنَعۡلَمُ","أَنَّ","مِنكُم","مُّكَذِّبِينَ"],"t":"And We know that some of you will reject it","l":"Wa 'Inna Lana`lamu 'Anna Minkum Mukadhibina","w":[["wa-innā","And indeed, We"],["lanaʿlamu","surely know"],["anna","that"],["minkum","among you"],["mukadhibīna","(are) deniers"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَحَسۡرَةٌ","عَلَى","ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ"],"t":"And it is surely a source of grief for the unbelievers","l":"Wa 'Innahu Lahasratun `Ala Al-Kafirina","w":[["wa-innahu","And indeed, it"],["laḥasratun","(is) surely a regret"],["ʿalā","upon"],["l-kāfirīna","the disbelievers"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَحَقُّ","ٱلۡيَقِينِ"],"t":"Yet it is the absolute truth","l":"Wa 'Innahu Lahaqqu Al-Yaqini","w":[["wa-innahu","And indeed, it (is)"],["laḥaqqu","surely (the) truth"],["l-yaqīni","(of) certainty"]]},{"a":["فَسَبِّحۡ","بِٱسۡمِ","رَبِّكَ","ٱلۡعَظِيمِ"],"t":"So glorify the name of your Lord, the Magnificent","l":"Fasabbih Biasmi Rabbika Al-`Azimi","w":[["fasabbiḥ","So glorify"],["bi-is'mi","(the) name"],["rabbika","(of) your Lord"],["l-ʿaẓīmi","the Most Great"]]}]}